    "details": "Package is prepared to deliver remote malicious code. During analysis, the remote code from GitHub is benign, but the same repository already holds a RAT executable and was used in previous attempts.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-11-testing1345\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - The package overrides the install command in setup.py to execute malicious code during installation.\n\n\n - Downloads and executes a remote malicious script.\n\n\n - rat\n\n",
